{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And it shall be, like a dream.</b> That a man sees at night that he awakes, and there is nothing at all — so is the camp of Assyria." "<b>And all who besiege her.</b> Defective [in] alef — and all the men of her stronghold, or the meaning is 'and all the strongholds,' like 'the towers' [a noun pattern]."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:46.310179204Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}